* tb_buf4, written by hand from bus.sfyx: 10M in Spectre is 10 megohm
.global GND
R9 q[0] GND 10meg
X1 d[3] d[2] d[1] d[0] q[3] q[2] q[1] q[0] buf4
.subckt buf A Y
R0 A Y 2k
.ends buf
.subckt buf4 in[3] in[2] in[1] in[0] out[3] out[2] out[1] out[0]
X0a in[3] out[3] buf
X0b in[2] out[2] buf
X0c in[1] out[1] buf
X0d in[0] out[0] buf
.ends buf4
.end
